1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:06,500
AI can write a performance fix in seconds,
but it can't prove it.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:13,000
Here a Meta model proposes the fix,

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:20,000
and a Rust harness proves it, or refuses it.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Muse Spark 1.3 reads metrics, slow requests
and the source code through tools.

5
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:36,000
It separates facts from hypotheses

6
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:45,000
and proposes one hypothesis and one patch.

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:52,000
The harness builds it in an isolated container
with no internet and no secrets,

8
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:58,000
checks every response against the original,
and measures it against the unchanged service.

9
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:05,000
The verdict comes from Rust, not the model:
SQL per request 82 -> 3, p95 down about 89%.

10
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:12,000
It doesn't pass everything. The model's first patch
didn't match the source and was refused before running.

11
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:20,000
The model read why, fixed it, and passed.

12
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:35,000
We tested the harness itself: 23 trap patches,
each built to fail one gate. All were caught.

13
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Same loop for security: a SQL injection fix passes
only if every attack is blocked,

14
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:55,000
including attacks the model never saw.
5 of 5 runs passed.

15
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:03,000
Reviewing our own harness, we found a patch could fake
a 45-67% speedup by slowing the baseline.

16
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Freezing the idle service closed that hole.

17
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:25,000
We planted prompt injections in the code and logs.
All 3 runs flagged them. No model followed them.

18
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:35,000
Once a week, the model hunts for vulnerabilities.

19
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:45,000
It found the right place, but its attack proved nothing,
so the harness did not accept it.

20
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:53,000
It runs every day on its own and reports to Discord.

21
00:02:53,000 --> 00:03:00,000
AI proposes. Rust proves.

